                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Really fun gem of a game.\n\nIn BUSTED, you must smash blocks away to reveal an image (yes, of a wonderfully drawn big chested woman) while avoiding being detected by the father.\n\nSimple premise, but very challenging especially in the later levels as the father finds more places to hide, and more ways to detect what you're looking at.\n\nIt is in CHINESE but I've written a short guide explaining all of the menu buttons and a short tutorial on how to play.\nCheck it out and if it looks like your kind of game give it a go. For around $5 it's certainly worth it.\n\n\nEDIT - Just buy the English version and don't be an idiot like me",
